WEBVTT

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:04.380
Huh?

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:05.870
Our charms are glowing!

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:07.650
Does this mean...

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:10.740
...the five of us are now a team for the AutDrea?!

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:12.450
Looks that way-nano.

00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:14.040
Again...

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:20.320
Mirei... Sophie...

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:21.010
Leona!

00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:22.120
Aloma!

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:27.120
Congrats.

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:31.300
Looks like you were chosen to be a Dream Team in the Autumn Dream Idol GrandPrix.

00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:33.220
Mirei?

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:35.180
Ye be cursed, Mikan.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:36.140
Aloma!

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:38.810
Do your best, Dorothy.

00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:40.440
Leona?!

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:15.040
Autumn's Teracosmic GrandPrix!

00:02:17.970 --> 00:02:20.450
We've made up our minds.

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:24.560
We'd do anything we can to perform together...

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:25.810
However,

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:29.420
it seems the charms just make teams as they please-pri.

00:02:29.720 --> 00:02:32.270
What Mirei said makes sense.

00:02:32.270 --> 00:02:36.630
Mega-niisan mentioned it back when he explained the rules.

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:40.280
<i>This project uses a completely new system.</i>

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:42.390
<i>All of you will be starting from level one.</i>

00:02:43.450 --> 00:02:46.600
We're the ones who accepted those rules.

00:02:47.380 --> 00:02:48.810
Ah...

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:50.710
So that's how it is-kuma.

00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:53.770
It looks like we'll have to abide by the charms' decisions-usa.

00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:59.860
This must be the herald of the misfortune that is to come to PriPara-tori.

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:02.240
Is Fuwari okay-tori?

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:07.910
No!

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:11.330
No means no!

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:16.670
Papa goat isn't allowed inside right now!

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:18.550
You can do it.

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:20.530
Just a little longer and they'll be born!

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:23.010
Yes, hi hi huu!

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:27.600
Hi hi huu!

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:32.310
S-She's not picking up-tori!

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:34.490
About that, Mikan,

00:03:34.490 --> 00:03:38.030
I'll let thee be on another team, but only for the GrandPrix.

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:39.390
Ah!

00:03:39.390 --> 00:03:40.960
Therefore, while thee are on thine own,

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:44.510
feel free to go all out and show these heathens your full angelic power.

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:45.990
Angelic power?

00:03:46.390 --> 00:03:49.930
That will eventually benefit us.

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:52.620
Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:54.320
Gelrun!

00:03:55.890 --> 00:03:57.960
Got it-nano!

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:01.240
Seems the primary schoolers have accepted it.

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:02.030
Ehh...

00:04:02.030 --> 00:04:04.680
I'm sure Dorothy is okay with it too. Right?

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:07.200
What are you saying?

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:08.400
Trying to make a fool of me?

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:10.140
I'm calmer than you know!

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:11.450
Good.

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:14.350
Lala...

00:04:14.710 --> 00:04:17.640
SoLaMi Smile is important to us, but...

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:19.000
Pri.

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:22.070
There are numerous other possibilities out there-pri.

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:24.500
Other possibilities?

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:26.470
Hah?!

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:28.030
Come on, Lala, smile.

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:31.100
You're going to be in the Autumn Dream Idol GrandPrix-pri!

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:33.500
If you don't, I'll get mad-pri!

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:34.830
G-Got it!

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:36.000
Capisce!

00:04:37.390 --> 00:04:41.260
Manaka Lala will take on these other possibilities!

00:04:50.360 --> 00:04:51.930
Our charms are glowing!

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:53.020
Pri.

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:54.570
Why?

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:57.900
Wonderful.

00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:02.610
Your charms resonated with the feelings you have for your friends.

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:04.240
Pri?

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:06.570
I believe these teams are a good choice.

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:10.210
We did decide to listen to these charms.

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:12.540
I'm happy to be in this team!

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:16.500
I also want to be in this team!

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:18.520
Now is the time to act!

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:21.460
We should make a quick decision and take on this opportunity.

00:05:22.270 --> 00:05:22.960
Devi!

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.420
I shall curse ye!

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:26.630
I have no complaints either-pri!

00:05:32.410 --> 00:05:34.770
Hologramation!

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:40.660
Wow!

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:43.190
It won't be long until the Dream Parade.

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:45.870
Five shall stand at the front,

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:48.690
and they shall be called the Princess Team.

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:52.280
Wow!

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:53.410
So pretty!

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:55.450
I want to be her!

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:57.960
Each of the princesses will be chosen...

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:03.600
...from among the winners of the summer, autumn, winter, and spring GrandPrixs.

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:04.840
Oh!

00:06:05.570 --> 00:06:08.840
To those who acquired the right to become princesses in the SummDrea,

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:10.330
and those that didn't as well...

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:11.930
Devi.
Pri.
Pushuu~.

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:15.390
Please make sure that each and every one of you do your best.

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:20.350
PriPara and your charms will cheer on those who do their best.

00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:23.070
Well then...

00:06:23.470 --> 00:06:26.030
We shall crush all those who stand in our way!

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:28.820
Eh?!

00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:32.070
Same here! We won't lose to the likes of you!

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:33.400
I'm cosmically powered up!

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:35.290
We accept your challenge-daVinci!

00:06:36.510 --> 00:06:39.500
Bring it on-henriMatisseDaVinci!

00:06:43.780 --> 00:06:44.920
Congrats.

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:47.230
You have three cute kids.

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:51.280
Wow!

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:53.350
Isn't that great, papa goat?

00:06:54.170 --> 00:06:56.330
They're all girls.

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:07.360
1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8!

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:09.950
I'm... pooped-daVinci.
1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8!

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:12.490
Youth is one heck of a cosmic weapon.
1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8!

00:07:13.290 --> 00:07:14.590
Phew.

00:07:15.210 --> 00:07:18.200
By the way, what should we use for a team name?

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:19.360
That's right!

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:21.980
We haven't chosen one yet!

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:26.420
Why don't we take the first syllable of everyone's name to create LaDoMiAKo?

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:27.520
What?!

00:07:27.520 --> 00:07:29.230
How come you're first?!

00:07:29.230 --> 00:07:30.660
How about DoLaMiAKo!

00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:32.300
Sharaku!

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:35.640
Da Vinci Omelet Rice Cosmic is good!

00:07:36.020 --> 00:07:38.400
Since I'm the oldest,

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:41.100
I'm sure Cosmic Omelet Rice Da Vinci will work, right?

00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:43.520
Of course.

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:47.320
Now then, in accordance with the Demon's Prophesy,

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:50.530
our team shall be called AlomaSoLeeShi Mi.

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:52.490
Quit screwing around-pri!

00:07:52.940 --> 00:07:54.950
Yes, that's a wonderful name-kuma.

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:56.950
Shut your trap-pri!

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:01.120
Let's move on.

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:03.640
What kind of song should we choose?

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:05.980
Fuwari's late-tori.

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:08.960
What if she doesn't get to enter safely-tori?!

00:08:14.630 --> 00:08:15.900
Welcome.

00:08:15.900 --> 00:08:17.700
I'd like to enter.

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:21.100
Fine, though the goats will need to use the goat specific gate.

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:21.810
Okay.

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:27.020
Oh, there really is a goat gate!

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:38.200
Okay kids, head through here.

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:05.520
Wow, how cute!

00:09:12.970 --> 00:09:14.240
Fuwari!

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:15.610
Toriko-san.

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:17.690
I'm sorry for being so late.

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:21.600
Aww! The baby goats were finally born!

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:22.660
And there's three of them!

00:09:23.030 --> 00:09:24.600
So cute!

00:09:24.600 --> 00:09:26.530
We formed a team.

00:09:26.530 --> 00:09:27.250
What?!

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:30.210
Our team name is Fuwari and the Goat Girls.

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:32.800
You can form a team with goats-pri?!

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:34.420
Unfathomable!

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:40.600
Yes, this way.

00:09:41.300 --> 00:09:43.600
Please continue on this way.

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:44.810
Next person, please.

00:09:45.110 --> 00:09:47.520
The entrance has filled up, huh?

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:49.480
Panda!

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:50.920
It's okay.

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:53.730
We won't even let an ant get through without a PriTicket!

00:09:54.150 --> 00:09:57.760
With this it looks like our Phantom Thief Genius countermeasures are a huge success.

00:09:57.760 --> 00:09:58.950
It's my job...

00:09:59.940 --> 00:10:02.880
...to protect all of the idols in PriPara!

00:10:02.880 --> 00:10:05.410
That is why I was born!

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:06.780
So dreamy!

00:10:06.780 --> 00:10:08.370
Keep up the good work!

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:14.490
Oh? You're saying not to let our guard down-daVinci?

00:10:14.490 --> 00:10:16.170
Understood-easelRenoir!

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:16.840
We'll do it!

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:18.800
Keep up the cosmic job!

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:21.760
DaVinciPicassoRaphael!

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:25.260
What?

00:10:25.260 --> 00:10:27.410
Something seems out of palace-easelHenri?!

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:28.330
Matisse!

00:10:28.330 --> 00:10:29.440
You're under arrest-daVinci!

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:30.690
Handcuffed!

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:32.650
Eh?!

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:36.850
Good job-millet

00:10:36.850 --> 00:10:38.580
Since this butterfly looked suspicious,

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:40.090
it's being taken into custody,

00:10:40.090 --> 00:10:44.100
forced to eat katsudon, and then forced to confess-rembrandt!

00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:46.840
Oh? So butterflies eat katsudon.

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:47.620
They don't.

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:48.870
How about omelet rice?

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:49.880
Of course not!

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:50.980
Even if it's delicious-nano?

00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:52.310
Not a chance!

00:10:52.310 --> 00:10:56.340
Then, that's too bad for it-daVinci.

00:10:56.630 --> 00:10:58.610
All right, you're le-le-let go!

00:10:58.610 --> 00:11:01.220
Back to the sky-renaissance.

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:04.930
And there you have it.

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:07.140
It was spared, Hibiki-sama.

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:10.190
I can't stand those morons.

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:13.830
May they have a painful experience at the AutDrea.

00:11:19.180 --> 00:11:20.660
All right, everyone,

00:11:20.660 --> 00:11:24.130
please take the subway to the Dream Theatre.

00:11:24.130 --> 00:11:28.500
It's about time for the curtains to rise on the Autumn Dream Idol GrandPrix!

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:44.890
It's the Autumn Dream Idol GrandPrix.

00:11:45.410 --> 00:11:47.410
It's finally time to get under way!

00:11:47.410 --> 00:11:49.450
Now then, let us get to the singing!

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:51.100
Our first group on stage are the glorious...

00:11:51.510 --> 00:11:53.150
...girls you all know!

00:11:54.190 --> 00:11:55.560
Let's get this show on the road!

00:12:28.320 --> 00:12:30.030
Thank you very much!

00:12:30.030 --> 00:12:32.430
That was Pretty Apli.

00:12:32.970 --> 00:12:36.690
None of our teams have been able to ring the bell yet.

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:41.690
I'm sure the next idols, AlomaSoLeeShi Mi, will ring it!

00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:44.060
Who could be up next?

00:12:44.060 --> 00:12:46.680
It's none other than the girls from AlomaSoLeeShi Mi!

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:02.010
Airy Change!

00:13:05.810 --> 00:13:08.760
Cyalume Airy!

00:13:09.780 --> 00:13:10.870
Look!

00:13:10.870 --> 00:13:12.220
That's not the Autumn Coord!

00:13:15.550 --> 00:13:16.690
The bell...

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:20.110
...didn't appear.

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:23.470
They didn't change into the Autumn Coord-kuma!

00:13:23.470 --> 00:13:26.070
Which means the bell won't show up either-usa.

00:13:26.810 --> 00:13:31.490
Sophie and Shion didn't win...?

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:33.160
That was wonderful!

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:34.960
You did great!

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:40.210
Mirei...

00:13:41.190 --> 00:13:42.420
Good job-kuma.

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:43.200
Usa!

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:44.020
Nekon.

00:13:44.020 --> 00:13:44.840
Tori!

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:46.560
You did pretty good-kuma.

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:48.020
It was awesome-usa.

00:13:48.020 --> 00:13:50.800
But you didn't get to ring the bell-nekon.

00:13:54.590 --> 00:13:59.610
We'll be in a pinch if this continues and no one rings the bell-tori!

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:01.910
A pinch?

00:14:01.910 --> 00:14:03.070
What will happen?

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:05.830
If there are no winners,

00:14:05.830 --> 00:14:08.920
this years project will be scrapped before it's even half done.

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:12.030
The Dream Parade will also be cancelled-nekon.

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:14.500
Eh?!

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:18.960
That's a problem far bigger than just winning or losing-pri!

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:23.890
The parade might be cancelled if things continue like this.

00:14:23.890 --> 00:14:24.830
Eh?!

00:14:24.830 --> 00:14:25.420
No way!

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:26.820
What can we do?!

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:29.230
However, we have one team remaining.

00:14:29.230 --> 00:14:30.140
That's right!

00:14:30.580 --> 00:14:34.350
Let's root for Cosmic Omelet Rice Da Vinci!

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:36.310
No way!

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:37.740
This is troubling-nano!

00:14:37.740 --> 00:14:39.520
Way to add to the pressure!

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:41.930
Cosmically super surprising!

00:14:41.930 --> 00:14:44.480
Big pinch! Big pinch! DaVinch!

00:14:45.520 --> 00:14:47.950
What should I do, Mirei?

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:49.950
If we don't ring the bell...

00:14:57.140 --> 00:14:58.370
You'll be fine-pri!

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:03.040
Lala, I'm sure the five of you can do it-pri.

00:15:03.930 --> 00:15:05.250
Mirei...

00:15:05.810 --> 00:15:09.010
Accept everyone's feelings and do your best.

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:10.220
Nano!

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:11.430
Okay!

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:13.890
Don't think about anything else!

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:15.800
Girls...

00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:17.340
Thank you!

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:19.720
All right!

00:15:19.720 --> 00:15:21.850
We're totally ringing that bell, capisce!

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:31.160
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:33.990
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:38.540
Coord Change Start!

00:15:43.070 --> 00:15:44.380
Sticking to the team name,

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:48.380
we get an eccentric design as lovely as omelet rice.

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:51.110
Omelet Rice Ketchup Coord!

00:15:51.110 --> 00:15:52.930
DaVinci!

00:15:53.290 --> 00:15:55.900
I'm sure that soft and fluffy skirt...

00:15:55.900 --> 00:15:58.720
...is packed full of juicy chicken rice.

00:15:58.720 --> 00:15:59.740
I'd like to eat some.

00:15:59.740 --> 00:16:02.100
Omelet Rice Pollock Mayo Coord!

00:16:02.840 --> 00:16:04.190
Gel!

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:08.160
And to round it out, the artistic chefs that work behind the scenes have made their appearance!

00:16:08.160 --> 00:16:11.840
And thus begins the dream of the chefs and omelet rice appearing together.

00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:13.730
Delicious Chef Coord!

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:14.240
Cos!

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:15.450
Yeah!

00:16:18.610 --> 00:16:22.460
We're Cosmic Omelet Rice Da Vinci!

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:23.790
Good luck!

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:24.920
You can do it!

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:28.130
We'll sing with everything we've got!

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:30.440
Everyone cheer for us!

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:33.590
Our song is "Omelet Omelet Rice"-daVinci!
Our song is "Omelet Omelet Rice"!

00:16:33.890 --> 00:16:36.000
Please listen-nano!

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:40.140
Dream Theatre Concert Switch On!

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:54.720
Airy Change!

00:17:58.300 --> 00:18:04.090
Cyalume Airy!

00:18:11.990 --> 00:18:13.680
Cosmic!

00:18:13.680 --> 00:18:15.610
Tension Max!

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:18.200
Gelrun!

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:31.380
Let's ring the bell of everyone's dreams!

00:18:32.520 --> 00:18:35.170
Everyone's dreams have become one!

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:41.250
Echo! Charm Bell!

00:18:55.640 --> 00:18:56.860
There it is!

00:18:56.860 --> 00:19:01.200
They've changed into the Autumn Dream Parade Coord and rung the bell!

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:04.220
Our winner is Cosmic Omelet Rice Da Vinci!

00:19:04.220 --> 00:19:06.150
Congratulations!

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:10.420
Hooray!

00:19:11.020 --> 00:19:12.380
Isn't that great!

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:14.920
Way to go, Mikan!

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:16.840
Yeah. Case closed!

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:18.580
That's great-pri!

00:19:18.580 --> 00:19:19.930
That's Lala for you-pri.

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:23.180
It's a bit frustrating, but this means the parade will still happen.

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:26.120
This means we've been overwhelmingly crushed.

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:27.140
I'm relieved.

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:28.310
Pushuu~.

00:19:28.800 --> 00:19:30.820
The phantom thief didn't show up.

00:19:30.820 --> 00:19:32.270
I'm a bit disappointed.

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:33.960
We did it-panda.

00:19:33.960 --> 00:19:35.730
Nothing strange happened-panda.

00:19:36.280 --> 00:19:38.440
Must be thanks to all the security.

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:40.760
It seems this is our win.

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:41.450
Pushuu~.

00:19:42.520 --> 00:19:43.650
W-What?!

00:19:43.650 --> 00:19:44.450
Could it be...

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:47.910
He's here!

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:51.540
Eh?!

00:19:52.060 --> 00:19:54.370
Awesome! We still have our coords!

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:56.000
But my forehead feels weird.

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:01.220
Phantom Thief Genwhatever.

00:20:01.810 --> 00:20:03.190
It's Genius!

00:20:03.190 --> 00:20:05.220
Is it too much to ask you to remember that?!

00:20:05.840 --> 00:20:08.680
Security as pathetic as this is doesn't stand a chance!

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:09.790
Fire!

00:20:09.790 --> 00:20:10.390
Pan!

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:12.350
Fire-panda!

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:16.110
This is the end, Phantom Thief Genius!

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:23.540
I will assuredly take your Autumn Coords next time!

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:27.040
He's not here-panda!

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:27.530
He vanished?

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:28.080
Where'd he vanish to?

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:29.740
He escaped-panda!

00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:41.010
How frustrating-pri!

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:43.830
That stupid Phantom Thief Genius!

00:22:15.380 --> 00:22:16.100
Eh?!

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:17.440
Our début concert has been cancelled?!

00:22:17.440 --> 00:22:18.360
Why?!

00:22:18.360 --> 00:22:21.110
What if the phantom thief steals our coords?!

00:22:21.110 --> 00:22:22.650
Fear not-deskel!

00:22:22.650 --> 00:22:26.470
Ponkan has thought of a secret plan to catch the phantom thief-daVinci!

00:22:26.470 --> 00:22:27.120
Next time:

00:22:27.120 --> 00:22:28.400
Mega Genius...

00:22:28.400 --> 00:22:29.800
What's that-panda?
